2026-10-31T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-2434) 'The native `modules/ggml/` module (RFD66606-2230) exposes a GDExtension surface (`Ggml.load_model`, `Ggml.run_inference`, `Ggml.load_lora`) consumed by per-model GDScript adapter files loaded under Godot's script sandbox.
 # tags: rfd:details
